00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:55.810
would say this outright that, you know, they
want to set a label when their product, they

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:58.880
think, will taste the best and they want to
leave some wiggle room for the fact that you

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:02.759
might not put your yogurt in the refrigerator
