00:07:02.759 --> 00:07:05.470
kind of being conservative even on that date
that they're setting

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:09.240
Speaker 1: when it comes to food waste.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:13.730
You know, we've talked for so long on this
program about you got a portion of food that

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:16.420
