00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:19.590
It already is sort of like by the time it
would get to the supermarket, it might not

00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:20.590
look so good.

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:24.920
So you lose some there, you lose food due
to spoilage and you lose food due to expiration

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:25.920
dates.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:30.009
And a question that's often asked is shouldn't
that all be donated somewhere?

00:07:30.009 --> 00:07:34.080
And one of the reasons that sometimes given
for why it's not is if you donate stuff to

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:36.750
